    {
      "flavor_text": "ぜんしんの　コブを　ふるわせて\nじしんのような　ゆれを　おこす。\nグレッグルと　ちかい　しゅるい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "전신의 혹을 진동시켜서\n지진과 같은 흔들림을 일으킨다.\n삐딱구리와 가까운 종이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "透過震動全身的瘤\n來引發地震般的晃動。\n與不良蛙是相近的物種。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En faisant vibrer tous les pustules de son corps,\nil peut provoquer des secousses similaires à celles\nd’un séisme. Il est proche des Cradopaud.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Beulen, die seinen ganzen Körper bedecken,\nkönnen Erschütterungen auf Erdbebenstärke\nerzeugen. Es ist artverwandt mit Glibunkel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando hace vibrar los bultos de su cuerpo,\nprovoca sacudidas que parecen terremotos.\nEstá emparentado con los Croagunk.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fa vibrare le protuberanze su tutto il corpo\nprovocando delle scosse simili a un terremoto.\nCome specie è affine ai Croagunk.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The vibrating of the bumps all over its body\ncauses earthquake-like tremors. Seismitoad and\nCroagunk are similar species.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
